["<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">合わせ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あわせ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">对接；相对；面向</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"78133\"><ruby>旅行代理店<rp>(</rp><rt>りょこうだいりてん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>問<rp>(</rp><rt>と</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わせてみよう。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Let&#x27;s ask a travel agent.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">合わせる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あわせる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">配合（节奏、速度等）；合并；联合；结合；合计；面对；与（某人）相对；比较；核对；使遭遇（不幸的命运等）；并排放置；连接；重叠；混合；掺合；刀剑相接；格斗</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"233367\">あなたの<ruby>計画<rp>(</rp><rt>けいかく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>合<rp>(</rp><rt>あ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>わせなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Your plan must fit in with mine.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あわただしい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">忙碌；繁忙；匆忙；仓促；迅速；快速；突然</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"85687\"><ruby>飛行機<rp>(</rp><rt>ひこうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>辺<rp>(</rp><rt>あた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>りで<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>動<rp>(</rp><rt>うご</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きがあわただしかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There was much activity around the plane.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あわてる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">慌张；惊慌失措；手忙脚乱；慌乱；匆忙；仓促；急忙</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"209661\">その<ruby>質問<rp>(</rp><rt>しつもん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はすっかりあわてた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The question threw him off his balance.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">哀れ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あわれ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">怜悯；悲伤；悲痛；不幸；同情；哀愁；可怜的；令人同情的；悲惨的；凄惨的；哎呀；唉</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"74068\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>哀<rp>(</rp><rt>あわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れを<ruby>誘<rp>(</rp><rt>さそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>う<ruby>有様<rp>(</rp><rt>ありさま</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She was in a piteous state.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アワー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">小时</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"192577\">ラッシュアワーの<ruby>交通渋滞<rp>(</rp><rt>こうつうじゅうたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にあった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I was caught in the rush hour.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">案</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">主意；计划；提案；建议；议案；草稿；初稿；预期；期望；书桌；台架</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"200764\">どちらの<ruby>案<rp>(</rp><rt>あん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がよりよいと<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いますか。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Which plan do you believe is better?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">安易</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">容易；简单；轻率；草率；随意；不负责任；粗心；仓促（行事）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">案外</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんがい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">意外地；出人意料地；令人惊讶地；意外的；出人意料的；令人惊讶的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"197622\">ピクニックは<ruby>案外<rp>(</rp><rt>あんがい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つまらなかった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The picnic was a disappointment.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暗記</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">记忆；背诵；记诵</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"113050\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>会話<rp>(</rp><rt>かいわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>暗記<rp>(</rp><rt>あんき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しようとした。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He tried to memorize the conversation.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アンケート</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">问卷调查；调查；民意测验</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224003\">このアンケート、<ruby>項目<rp>(</rp><rt>こうもく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>多<rp>(</rp><rt>おお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>すぎて<ruby>記入<rp>(</rp><rt>きにゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>する<ruby>気<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>になれないよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I don&#x27;t feel like filling out this questionnaire. There are too many items.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アンコール</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">安可；要求加演</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暗殺</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんさつ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">暗杀</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"96596\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らは<ruby>大統領<rp>(</rp><rt>だいとうりょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>暗殺<rp>(</rp><rt>あんさつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>企<rp>(</rp><rt>くわだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>てた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">They attempted to assassinate the president.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暗算</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんざん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">心算</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">安心</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんしん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">安心；放心；心安；安全感；保障；自信</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"234664\">あいつに<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>任<rp>(</rp><rt>まか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>せておけば<ruby>安心<rp>(</rp><rt>あんしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>だ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You can trust him with any job.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">暗示</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんじ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">暗示；提示；线索；言外之意；（心理学）暗示；心理暗示</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">案じる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんじる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">担心；忧虑；为…感到不安；想出；设想；筹划；考虑；思考；调查；查证；抚摸；摩擦；拍打；握住（剑柄）</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"102717\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>息子<rp>(</rp><rt>むすこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>将来<rp>(</rp><rt>しょうらい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をとても<ruby>案<rp>(</rp><rt>あん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>じている。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He is very much concerned about the future of his son.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">安静</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんせい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">休息；安静；静养</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"216105\">しばらく<ruby>安静<rp>(</rp><rt>あんせい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にしておきなさい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Keep quiet in bed for a while.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">安全</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんぜん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">安全；保障</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"165729\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>たちは<ruby>思<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っているほど<ruby>安全<rp>(</rp><rt>あんぜん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>ではない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">We are not all that safe.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">安定</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんてい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">稳定；稳固；一致；平衡；均衡；镇定；（物理、化学）稳定的；处于稳态的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"110189\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>安定<rp>(</rp><rt>あんてい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>失<rp>(</rp><rt>うしな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>倒<rp>(</rp><rt>たお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He lost his balance and fell down.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">アンテナ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">天线；信息收集工具；舆情探针</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"224001\">このアンテナを<ruby>屋根<rp>(</rp><rt>やね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>につけると<ruby>画面<rp>(</rp><rt>がめん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がはっきりする。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You&#x27;ll get a clear picture with this antenna on the roof.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あんな</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">连体词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">連体詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">那样的；那种；像那样的；如此的</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"75577\">あんないい<ruby>男<rp>(</rp><rt>おとこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>そうそういないぞ！！</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There aren&#x27;t many blokes that nice!</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">案内</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんない</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">引导；带路；指引；信息；通知；告知；来访通报；通报访客到来；邀请；邀约；相识；了解；知晓</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"152174\"><ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をあちこちに<ruby>案内<rp>(</rp><rt>あんない</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してください。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Please show me around.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あんなに</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">那么；那样地</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229563\">あんなに<ruby>怒<rp>(</rp><rt>おこ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>るなんて<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>らしくない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">It&#x27;s unlike him to get so angry.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">案の定</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">あんのじょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">副詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">果然；不出所料；正如所担心的那样</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"191241\"><ruby>案<rp>(</rp><rt>あん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>定<rp>(</rp><rt>じょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>、<ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>電話<rp>(</rp><rt>でんわ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をかけてきた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She called me up, as I had expected.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">あんまり</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">副词</