/n5/vocab/\">N5</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">感叹词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">感動詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不；没有；不用谢；别客气；不足挂齿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">いい加減</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いいかげん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">な形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">な形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">不负责任；敷衍；马虎；不冷不热；半生不熟；敷衍了事；含糊其辞；（已经）足够；适可而止；相当；颇；甚为；很</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"229411\">いいかげんに<ruby>仕事<rp>(</rp><rt>しごと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をするな。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Don&#x27;t do the job just any old way.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">言い出す</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いいだす</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">开始说；开口；提出；谈起；抢先提出；建议；提议</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"218583\">これはだれかの<ruby>言<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>出<rp>(</rp><rt>だ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>したことかい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Was this somebody else&#x27;s idea?</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">言い付ける</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">いいつける</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">吩咐；命令；指示；告状；举报；告密；常说；习惯性地说</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"111959\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はちゃんと<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>